{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a <strong>score-chaser or speedrun fan</strong>, a <strong>casual player</strong>, or a <strong>tryharder</strong> looking for a speed challenge? <strong>This game is for you</strong> and it won't cost you anything but your time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989160/extras/9f4b2a1cd8f8165cf4fe13e11fefbc42.poster.avif?t=1766024693\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989160/extras/9f4b2a1cd8f8165cf4fe13e11fefbc42.webm?t=1766024693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989160/extras/9f4b2a1cd8f8165cf4fe13e11fefbc42.mp4?t=1766024693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've all rushed through the first level of a video game or tried out time trials. In that mind, Super Jetboy World is a <strong>fast-paced 2D platformer</strong> with new and original mechanics that make the game's speed challenges <strong>accessible to everyone</strong>, no matter your skill level. Each level's gameplay is <strong>broken down into multiple sections</strong>, allowing you to <strong>retry each segment</strong>, giving you a <strong>margin of error</strong> to achieve your <strong>perfect run and best score</strong> without pressure or frustration! The controls are <strong>easy to grasp</strong>, <strong>a bunch of tools are available</strong> to the player to help them <strong>improve easily</strong>, and every level is <strong>designed to be satisfying and fun</strong> to play, all while maintaining a certain level of difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989160/extras/f7a4e4d80f3d83c10e32774d3730b1f9.poster.avif?t=1766024693\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989160/extras/f7a4e4d80f3d83c10e32774d3730b1f9.webm?t=1766024693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989160/extras/f7a4e4d80f3d83c10e32774d3730b1f9.mp4?t=1766024693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worried you won\u2019t measure up? <strong>No worries</strong>! In this game, you set <strong>your own goals</strong>, allowing for difficulty <strong>tailored to you</strong>. The game will only <strong>require you to surpass a small score objective</strong> based on <strong>player feedback</strong>, the bare minimum to <strong>progress in the adventure</strong> and <strong>get to grips with the game\u00a0</strong>(and offers several adjustable difficulty settings). But <strong>every effort is rewarded</strong>, whether it's achieving an excellent score, completing a run without dying, or finishing bonus challenges. If you're a <strong>speed lover</strong> or have always <strong>watched speedruns</strong>, this is <strong>your chance to give it a shot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989160/extras/ff9a1ca2730089a58e5e829dfb1d021e.poster.avif?t=1766024693\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989160/extras/ff9a1ca2730089a58e5e829dfb1d021e.webm?t=1766024693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989160/extras/ff9a1ca2730089a58e5e829dfb1d021e.mp4?t=1766024693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Jetboy World actually <strong>perfects the formula of its predecessor</strong>, simply &quot;Super Jetboy&quot; <i>(or <strong>&quot;Super Jetboy Legacy&quot;</strong>)</i> <strong>created in 2 days</strong> for the first edition of the SpeedJam, a <strong>game jam focused on score-chasing and speedrunning</strong>. With the experience gained since then, the power of the Godot engine, and no time constraints, Super Jetboy World delivers <strong>a superior experience</strong>, <strong>succeeding where the first game fell short</strong>, while keeping its soul and <strong>iconic theme</strong> that you'll soon hear. Super Jetboy World also draws <strong>inspiration from top speedrun</strong> and <strong>2D platformer</strong> titles like <strong>Super Meatboy</strong>, <strong>Celeste</strong>, and <strong>Pizza Tower</strong>, aiming to deliver an experience <strong>close to these amazing games, for free</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989160/extras/e1d5166ca286faa1ea9c3451c1951cf2.poster.avif?t=1766024693\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989160/extras/e1d5166ca286faa1ea9c3451c1951cf2.webm?t=1766024693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989160/extras/e1d5166ca286faa1ea9c3451c1951cf2.mp4?t=1766024693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story\u2019s recipe is simple and relevant <i>(at least in the 21st century!)</i>: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>rogue AI</strong> obsessed with progress at the cost of all living beings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endearing friends and foes</strong> with hidden pasts and secrets </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story <strong>full of humor</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world filled with <strong>unique landscapes</strong> and <strong>colorful robots</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, colorful, and charming <strong>pixel art</strong> reminiscent of <strong>arcade games</strong> with a modern touch </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>robot <i>(you)</i></strong> whose <strong>memory holds mysteries</strong> and must <strong>hurry to save nature</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989160/extras/b9d1a6f139cc773d2ff17bae19ae1248.poster.avif?t=1766024693\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989160/extras/b9d1a6f139cc773d2ff17bae19ae1248.webm?t=1766024693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989160/extras/b9d1a6f139cc773d2ff17bae19ae1248.mp4?t=1766024693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? <strong>Take on the challenge</strong>! It\u2019s <strong>free</strong> and <strong>packed with fun and content</strong>, thanks to numerous updates both past and future! Good luck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;Ready? Set... JET!!!&quot;</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2989160?t=1766024693","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=17660246