>, allowing you to <strong>retry each segment</strong>, giving you a <strong>margin of error</strong> to achieve your <strong>perfect run and best score</strong> without pressure or frustration! The controls are <strong>easy to grasp</strong>, <strong>a bunch of tools are available</strong> to the player to help them <strong>improve easily</strong>, and every level is <strong>designed to be satisfying and fun</strong> to play, all while maintaining a certain level of difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989160/extras/f7a4e4d80f3d83c10e32774d3730b1f9.poster.avif?t=1766024693\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989160/extras/f7a4e4d80f3d83c10e32774d3730b1f9.webm?t=1766024693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989160/extras/f7a4e4d80f3d83c10e32774d3730b1f9.mp4?t=1766024693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worried you won\u2019t measure up? <strong>No worries</strong>! In this game, you set <strong>your own goals</strong>, allowing for difficulty <strong>tailored to you</strong>. The game will only <strong>require you to surpass a small score objective</strong> based on <strong>player feedback</strong>, the bare minimum to <strong>progress in the adventure</strong> and <strong>get to grips with the game\u00a0</strong>(and offers several adjustable difficulty settings). But <strong>every effort is rewarded</strong>, whether it's achieving an excellent score, completing a run without dying, or finishing bonus challenges. If you're a <strong>speed lover</strong> or have always <strong>watched speedruns</strong>, this is <strong>your chance to give it a shot!</strong></p><